hwa Anda membuat tanda tangan elektronik yang mengikat secara hukum berdasarkan 21 CFR Part 11."}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tanda tangan pertama Anda dalam satu sesi meminta "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Nama pengguna", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Username", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") dan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Kata Sandi", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Password", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "): "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Ini adalah tanda tangan pertama Anda untuk sesi ini.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tanda tangan berikutnya dalam sesi yang sama hanya meminta kata kunci: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Anda memiliki sesi tanda tangan aktif. Masukkan kata kunci untuk melanjutkan.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Klik "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Tanda tangan", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Sign", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Batal", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Cancel", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") menutup dialog tanpa menyimpan."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "align-start", "width": 1020, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 2880, "alt": "Gambar 7. Tanda tangan pertama dalam satu sesi: Aksi dan Arti Tanda Tangan, dengan Nama pengguna dan Kata kunci.", "id": "e8149031-1b84-425f-8589-fbd4bc83a03f", "collection": "contentId-1439072277", "type": "file", "height": 1800}}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Gambar 7. Tanda tangan pertama dalam satu sesi: Aksi dan Arti Tanda Tangan, dengan Nama pengguna dan Kata kunci.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "align-start", "width": 1020, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 3600, "alt": "Gambar 8. Tanda tangan berikutnya dalam sesi yang sama hanya meminta kata kunci.", "id": "983d616d-96f0-469c-9225-c86b620cf1bf", "collection": "contentId-1439072277", "type": "file", "height": 2000}}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Gambar 8. Tanda tangan berikutnya dalam sesi yang sama hanya meminta kata kunci.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Setelah disimpan, status baris berubah menjadi "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Accepted by technician", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", nilainya menjadi hanya-baca, dan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Edit", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Edit", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") menggantikan Simpan. Deretan chip diperbarui, misalnya "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Belum dimulai (4)", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " dan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Accepted by technician (1)", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Setiap baris disimpan secara terpisah; tidak ada satu tombol Simpan untuk seluruh daftar."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "align-start", "width": 1020, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 3600, "alt": "Gambar 9. Setelah penyimpanan pertama: White Blood Cells Count menampilkan Accepted by technician dengan Sunting, dan chip menunjukkan Belum dimulai (4) dan Accepted by technician (1).", "id": "01f5f4df-e762-4fbb-84f8-ea48a2aa2fc2", "collection": "contentId-1439072277", "type": "file", "height": 2000}}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Gambar 9. Setelah penyimpanan pertama: White Blood Cells Count menampilkan Accepted by technician dengan Sunting, dan chip menunjukkan Belum dimulai (4) dan Accepted by technician (1).", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Selesaikan baris yang tersisa.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Klik chip status untuk memfilter tabel berdasarkan status tersebut: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Belum dimulai", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " hanya menampilkan baris yang masih memerlukan hasil, dan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Semua", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "All", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") menampilkan seluruh baris kembali. Ulangi langkah 3 sampai 5 untuk setiap baris yang tersisa."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "align-start", "width": 1020, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 3600, "alt": "Gambar 10. Kelima hasil telah disimpan dan ditandatangani: Accepted by technician (5), dengan penanda tetap ditampilkan di samping setiap nilai.", "id": "2c592ad5-eca1-4b25-bc42-ae4a61c17b77", "collection": "contentId-1439072277", "type": "file", "height": 2000}}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Gambar 10. Kelima hasil telah disimpan dan ditandatangani: Accepted by technician (5), dengan penanda tetap ditampilkan di samping setiap nilai.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Koreksi nilai yang telah disimpan, jika diperlukan.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Edit", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " pada baris yang telah disimpan mengembalikan nilai ke kotak yang dapat diedit. Penyimpanan nilai yang telah dikoreksi tidak diuji saat halaman ini ditulis."}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "align-start", "width": 1020, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 3600, "alt": "Gambar 11. Sunting pada baris White Blood Cells Count: nilai tersimpan 6.8 dapat diedit kembali.", "id": "7903eb7b-7127-442a-9316-0bd2aba9290d", "collection": "contentId-1439072277", "type": "file", "height": 2000}}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Gambar 11. Sunting pada baris White Blood Cells Count: nilai tersimpan 6.8 dapat diedit kembali.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Keterangan kolom"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Kolom atau kontrol"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Catatan"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cari"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pencarian berdasarkan nomor registrasi. Tekan Enter untuk memuat semua pemeriksaan pada pemesanan tersebut."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Instalasi Lab"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Instalasi lab yang pemeriksaannya ingin Anda tampilkan. Gunakan bersama Muat hasil."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tanggal Pemeriksaan"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Kolom tanggal (dd/mm/yyyy) di samping Instalasi Lab. Tidak diuji untuk halaman ini."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cari berdasarkan Pasien"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pencarian pasien. Memilih pasien akan memuat pemeriksaannya; Pilih pasien lain dan Kosongkan kemudian muncul."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chip status"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Semua, ditambah satu chip untuk setiap status yang ada pada baris yang dimuat, masing-masing dengan jumlahnya. Klik untuk memfilter."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sampel / Pasien"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Nomor registrasi, dengan nama, identitas, jenis kelamin, dan tanggal lahir pasien di bawahnya."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pemeriksaan"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Nama pemeriksaan dengan jenis sampelnya dalam tanda kurung."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Metode / Analyser"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ditampilkan sebagai tanda strip sampai diisi pada baris yang dibuka."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sampel"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Jenis sampel, misalnya Whole Blood."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rentang Referensi"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rentang rujukan dan satuan untuk pemeriksaan tersebut."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Hasil"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Kotak angka atau daftar pilihan, tergantung jenis hasil pemeriksaan. Hanya-baca setelah Simpan sampai Sunting diklik."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Status"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Belum dimulai sebelum Simpan; Accepted by technician sesudahnya. Baris yang dikembalikan dari tahap validasi dapat berstatus Not accepted by biologist."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Penanda"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Normal atau Tidak normal terhadap rentang rujukan, ditampilkan segera setelah nilai dimasukkan dan tetap ada setelah Simpan."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Aksi"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Kosong sampai nilai dimasukkan; lalu Simpan; lalu Sunting setelah disimpan."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tanda Tangan Elektronik"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ditampilkan saat Simpan jika tanda tangan diaktifkan. Nama pengguna dan Kata kunci pada tanda tangan pertama dalam satu sesi, lalu hanya Kata kunci."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tips"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pencarian berdasarkan nomor registrasi memuat semua pemeriksaan pada pemesanan tanpa memandang instalasi lab, dan merupakan cara tercepat untuk mengisi hasil satu sampel."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tombol Simpan baru muncul setelah nilai dimasukkan. Jika Anda tidak melihatnya, berarti kotak Hasil masih kosong."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Periksa Penanda sebelum menyimpan: penanda Tidak normal merupakan isyarat bagi Anda untuk mencocokkan nilai dengan sampelnya sebelum diteruskan ke validator."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Kolom Penanda dan Aksi dapat terpotong di tepi kanan tabel pada jendela yang lebih kecil. Tabel dapat digulir ke samping."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tanda tangan elektronik diaktifkan per situs. Jika Simpan selesai tanpa dialog tanda tangan, berarti fitur ini tidak aktif di situs Anda. Lihat "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Tanda tangan elektronik", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1242759175"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Peringatan pop-up untuk hasil di luar rentang valid diatur oleh "}, {"type": "text", "text": "alertWhenInvalidResult", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " di "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Menu Utama", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " → "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Admin", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " → "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Konfigurasi Umum", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " → "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Konfigurasi Entri Hasil", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Pengaturan ini tidak aktif pada situs rujukan, sehingga peringatan tersebut tidak muncul pada gambar-gambar ini."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Belum didokumentasikan"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Filter "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Tanggal Pemeriksaan", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "; penyimpanan nilai setelah "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Edit", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "; "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Laporkan KTS", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " dan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rujuk pemeriksaan ini", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "; pilihan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Metode", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " dan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Analyser", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "; catatan; bagian-bagian "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Reference & Context", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "; pemeriksaan dengan lebih dari satu komponen hasil; kontrol hasil berupa daftar pilihan dan titer; hasil kritis dan konfirmasinya. Tidak satu pun dari hal tersebut diuji untuk halaman ini."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Asal-usul"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Status"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Diperbarui untuk 3.3.0; peninjauan diminta"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Instans"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "testing.openelis-global.org", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", OpenELIS "}, {"type": "text", "text": "3.3.0", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rute"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "/Results", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". "}, {"type": "text", "text": "/LogbookResults", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " dialihkan ke sini."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Konfigurasi"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tanda tangan elektronik aktif; "}, {"type": "text", "text": "alertWhenInvalidResult", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " false; "}, {"type": "text", "text": "allowResultRejection", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " false. Konfigurasi Entri Hasil tidak lagi mencantumkan "}, {"type": "text", "text": "resultsEntryUnifiedRoute", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Diambil"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "12 Oktober 2026, pemesanan DEV01260000000000506 (pasien Agnes Bunari, lima pemeriksaan Hematologi). Gambar 7 berasal dari DEV01260000000000503 pada hari yang sama, karena dialog tanda tangan pertama hanya muncul sekali per sesi."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bukti"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Diuji: pencarian berdasarkan nomor registrasi; pemuatan berdasarkan instalasi lab; pencarian dan pemilihan pasien (pemeriksaan dimuat); entri nilai numerik (penanda Normal dan Tidak normal muncul sebelum Simpan); membuka baris; Simpan dengan tanda tangan elektronik, pertama dalam sesi (nama pengguna dan kata kunci) dan berikutnya (hanya kata kunci); kelima hasil disimpan; filter chip status; Sunting (nilai dapat diedit kembali). Hanya diamati: kontrol Metode, Analyser, Catatan, Reagents, QC & Controls, dan Reference & Context pada baris yang dibuka. Tidak diuji: semua hal di bawah Belum didokumentasikan."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Gambar"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "11 terlampir, diambil pada resolusi 1800×1000 agar seluruh baris daftar kerja terlihat, kecuali Gambar 7 (1440×900)."}]}]}]}]}], "version": 1}}